ou have to be a couple beers in  before you have some uni but if that's  probably the weirdest thing i've ever  had is sea urchin who would you want to  play you in the movie of your life  mark wahlberg because we look a lot  alike or uh brett favre  uh or chris jericho chris  would you rather have three eyes or  three arms i feel like i got three eyes  already um three arms then i could play  guitar a little bit differently would  you rather never gain weight from junk  food or never get hangovers from  drinking well i don't drink anymore  anyways so uh i would like to never gain  weight from uh eating junk food  especially zingers they did  would you rather here just any language  or be able to talk to animals talk to  animals i think um  because i have a i have two greyhounds  and i would love to be able to talk to  my greyhounds what's your guilty  pleasure  abba  [Laughter]  uh steel panther i think those are my  two guilty pleasures  what's the random stat of your life that  you would want someone to know well i'm  5 11. i think not enough people realize  that whenever i'm standing next to tall  guys people think i'm a manlet the thing  i'm like this tall like i'm hanging out  with guys like uh  like uh adam's a good example of this as  well but like uh when i hang out with  the kiyosakis like robert kiyosaki or if  i'm with george gammon or some of these  other guys that i hang out with i don't  know why it is that this industry  attracts some very tall gentlemen but  i'm 511 and these guys are like six foot  three so every time i take a picture  with them i'm like  this this tall next to them so i want  everyone here's a random stat i'm  actually five foot eleven thank you hot  feminist or overweight red pill chick oh  jesus hot feminist  because i could i could turn her would  you rather be with aoc or sarah huckabee  sanders oh hey aoc because i could turn  her  thank you for watching valuetaining  questions with rolo tomasi be sure to  check out my latest